:22:30.776Z","creator":{"name":"Find the Badges!","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":77349860902889,"name":"BloxLife [👽 SUPERNATURAL]","desc":"🌟 BloxLife - Life Simulator\n\nThis game is inspired by Candywriter LLC's BitLife. \n\nLive your life from birth to death! Make choices that shape your destiny. Will you become rich, start a family, or end up in prison?\n\n⭐ FEATURES:\n• Age up year by year and manage your health, happiness, smarts & looks\n• Get married, have kids, and continue as your child when you die\n• Work jobs, go to school, or start your own business\n• Invest in stocks and crypto with live price updates\n• Buy houses, cars, and boats\n• Build relationships with family and friends\n• Join the military or become a criminal\n• Random events every year keep it interesting\n• Start a business\n• Become the PRESIDENT?!\n\n💰 MAKE MONEY:\nTrade cryptocurrency and stocks with real charts. Buy real estate and collect rent. Work your way up to high-paying careers. Every life is different!\n\n\nYour choices matter. Start your life now!\nAll events are fictional and not based on real life events.","path":"/game/77349860902889-bloxlife","slug":"77349860902889-bloxlife","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/429532fbded3fec25c9b5f21318586bc67b62341837b6fbc0bd4f848ff30fd58.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cc336bb2976ab63e9d21fa4b11b62018/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":24,"visitor":5865818,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-09T20:30:45.106Z","creator":{"name":"Dynamite Inc","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10772052398,"name":"Defender's Depot 2 - Tower Defense","desc":"Welcome to Defender's Depot 2, build towers and traps to defend from waves of enemies in an epic new tower defense game!\n\n⚔️Use towers and traps to defeat waves of enemies\n⬆️Upgrade your defenses to unlock new abilities\n💥Defeat challenging enemies and hardcore